				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キズぐすりの　数は　ばっちり！
これなら　ジムリーダーに　勝てそう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
